{{Velious Era}}

The Tower of the Frozen Shadow was intended to be a beachhead for Mayong Mistmoore's influence in Velious. Vampire acolytes, undead refugees of the Erudite Civil War, and abominations fill all seven floors. Each floor requires a key to access the next floor. 

'''Warnings:'''
*'''Keys are not soulbound In the case of death, you will need to be Resurrected, have your [[Summon Corpse|corpse summoned]], or have a player use their key in group to get you back to the floor you died on.  
*'''Some creatures here ([[a ghostly scholar]]) are capable of charming your pets and using them against you.'''

<br><br>
After Mayong Mistmoore abandoned his former lover Tserrina Syl'Tor and warded it to prevent her escape, she has put a formidable curse upon the residents of the tower. Each day Tserrina slaves in her laboratory for a cure to her unique vampiric affliction, losing more of her mind as time passes.
